# A present for mum in Russian: маме, брату
subtitle: "Say who a present is for in Russian: дарю́ ма́ме цветы́. The one who gets it takes the to-ending, е for words in а and у for words in a consonant."
teaches: ["grammar/to-ending"]
thumb: "band \"A present for mum? Mum changes\" note \"ма́ме\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Making plans in Russian: давай пойдём в кино","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/46-russian-plans.cast"}

## A present for mum in Russian: маме, брату
