    card title "A present for mum"

A: How do you say who a present is for in Russian?
    draw i_gift

A: Flowers for mum, say, or a present for your brother?
    draw i_flowers

B: Я дарю́ ма́ме цветы́.
    draw g_open

A: Дарю́ is I give, as a present, and цветы́ are flowers: I give mum flowers.
    highlight g_open_w_2 effect underline color #c9871a

A: But listen to mum: ма́ма…
    draw t_from

A: …has become ма́ме. The one who gets the present changes its end.
    draw t_arrow t_to

B: In lesson twenty-nine, мне, тебе́, ему́ and ей were the to-words, the dative.
    draw t_pron

    erase t_pron

B: Now nouns take it too. We'll call it the to-ending.
    draw t_name

    erase i_gift i_flowers g_open t_from t_arrow t_to t_name

B: Words in а take е…
    draw h_left b_div

B: …and words that end in a consonant take у.
    draw h_right

A: A present is пода́рок, so a present for mum is пода́рок ма́ме.
    draw r_mum_b r_mum r_mum_g s_mum s_mum_g

    erase s_mum s_mum_g

B: Сестра́ swaps its а too: я дарю́ сестре́ кни́гу, I give my sister a book.
    draw r_sis_b r_sis r_sis_g s_sis s_sis_g

A: Two endings in one sentence: сестре́ is who gets it, and кни́гу, lesson fourteen's object ending, is what she gets.
    highlight s_sis effect underline color #c9871a part кни́гу

    erase s_sis s_sis_g

B: My own name does it too: Ма́ша, Ма́ше.
    draw r_masha_b r_masha r_masha_g

B: For words in а, it's the same е as in в Москве́, but only for them.
    draw s_masha s_masha_g

    erase s_masha s_masha_g

    quiz "Now guess: a present for my brother. Пода́рок … ? Pick one." store chk voice a
        right: Брат ends in a consonant, so it takes the other column: у.
        wrong: Бра́те is the place form, like в Ло́ндоне. Брат ends in a consonant: which column is that?
        * бра́те
        + бра́ту
        * бра́та

B: So my brother's present is пода́рок бра́ту.
    draw r_bro_b r_bro r_bro_g s_bro s_bro_g

    erase s_bro s_bro_g

A: His name, Ива́н, does the same: Ива́ну.
    draw r_ivan_b r_ivan r_ivan_g

A: And даю́ is plain I give, I hand over: я даю́ коту́ молоко́, I give the cat milk.
    draw r_cat_b r_cat r_cat_g s_cat s_cat_g

    erase s_cat s_cat_g

A: Now lesson thirty-eight's к врачу́ makes sense: врач, plus у.
    draw r_doc_b r_doc r_doc_g

B: So for a word in а, the one who gets it takes е…
    highlight r_mum r_sis r_masha color #c9871a

A: …and for a word in a consonant, it takes у.
    highlight r_bro r_ivan r_cat r_doc color #c9871a

    hide h_left h_right b_div r_mum_b r_mum r_mum_g r_sis_b r_sis r_sis_g r_masha_b r_masha r_masha_g r_bro_b r_bro r_bro_g r_ivan_b r_ivan r_ivan_g r_cat_b r_cat r_cat_g r_doc_b r_doc r_doc_g

B: Today is my mum's birthday, and Tom finds me with flowers.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name masha_fl parallel true

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, кому́ цветы́?","gloss":"Masha, who are the flowers for?"},{"by":"b","text":"Ма́ме. Сего́дня у ма́мы день рожде́ния!","gloss":"For mum. Today is mum's birthday!"}] size 1.3

    draw talk

A: Кому́ means to whom, or who for: it's кто with the to-ending, like ему́.
    highlight talk_1_words effect underline color #c9871a part кому́

B: День рожде́ния is a birthday, and у ма́мы is lesson twenty-eight's у меня́ pattern: mum has a birthday.
    highlight talk_2_words effect underline color #c9871a part ма́мы

    erase talk

    dialogue talkb speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"А что да́рит Ива́н?","gloss":"And what is Ivan, your brother, giving?"},{"by":"b","text":"Ива́н да́рит ма́ме кни́гу.","gloss":"Ivan is giving mum a book."}] size 1.3

    draw talkb

A: Дари́ть goes like люби́ть: дарю́, да́ришь, да́рит.
    highlight talkb_1_words effect underline color #c9871a part да́рит

    erase talkb

    dialogue talk2 speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"А что ты да́ришь коту́?","gloss":"And what are you giving the cat?"},{"by":"b","text":"Коту́? Я даю́ ему́ молоко́!","gloss":"The cat? I give him milk!"}] size 1.3

    draw talk2

B: First коту́, then ему́: the to-ending and the to-words do the same job.
    highlight talk2_2_words effect underline color #c9871a part ему́

    erase talk2

    hide speakers

    icon t1_pic size 130 set twemoji x 430 y 560 or ["gift","present"] icon_look picture of "wrapped gift"
    icon t1_pic2 size 130 set twemoji x 570 y 560 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman

    quiz "A present for mum: пода́рок … Which word fills the gap?" store q1 reveal.text "пода́рок ма́ме" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Ма́ма swaps its а for е: ма́ме.
        wrong: Ма́му is the object ending, and ма́мы the of-ending; to mum takes another.
        * ма́му
        * ма́мы
        + ма́ме

    pause 1.2

    erase t1_pic t1_pic2 q1_stamp

    icon t2_pic size 130 set twemoji x 430 y 560 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat
    icon t2_pic2 size 130 set twemoji x 570 y 560 or ["milk"] icon_look picture of "glass of milk"

    quiz "I give the cat milk: Я даю́ … молоко́. Which word fills the gap?" store q2 reveal.text "Я даю́ коту́ молоко́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Кот ends in a consonant, so it adds у.
        wrong: Кота́ is the of-ending, as in нет кота́; the one who gets the milk takes у.
        * кота́
        + коту́
        * кот

    pause 1.2

    erase t2_pic t2_pic2 q2_stamp

    icon t3_pic size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["bouquet","tulip"] icon_look picture of bouquet

    ask "I give my sister flowers: Я дарю́ … цветы́. Type the missing word." answer ["сестре"] store q3 default сестре́ reveal.text "Я дарю́ сестре́ цветы́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Сестра́ ends in а, so the а turns into е: сестре́.
        wrong: Start from сестра́, and swap its last letter.

    pause 1.2

    erase t3_pic q3_stamp

    icon t4_pic size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["gift","present"] icon_look picture of "wrapped gift"

    quiz "What does Кому́ пода́рок? mean? Pick one." store q4 say_answer false reveal.text "Кому́ пода́рок?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Кому́ is to whom: it asks who gets the present.
        wrong: Whose would be чей; кому́ has the to-ending.
        + Who is the present for?
        * Whose present is it?
        * Where is the present?

    pause 1.2

    erase t4_pic q4_stamp

    icon t5_pic size 130 set twemoji x 430 y 560 or ["gift","present"] icon_look picture of "wrapped gift"
    icon t5_pic2 size 130 set twemoji x 570 y 560 or ["man-beard","person beard"] icon_look picture of "man beard"

    quiz "And a present for dad: пода́рок … Which word fills the gap?" store q5 reveal.text "пода́рок па́пе" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Па́па is a he, but he ends in а, and а turns into е.
        wrong: Look at the last letter, not at he or she.
        * па́па
        * па́пу
        + па́пе

    pause 1.2

    erase t5_pic t5_pic2 q5_stamp

    show h_left h_right b_div r_mum r_mum_g r_sis r_sis_g r_masha r_masha_g r_bro r_bro_g r_ivan r_ivan_g r_cat r_cat_g r_doc r_doc_g

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So in Russian, the one who gets something wears the to-ending: mostly е for a word in а, and у for a word in a consonant.
    highlight r_mum r_bro color #c9871a

    erase h_left h_right b_div r_mum r_mum_g r_sis r_sis_g r_masha r_masha_g r_bro r_bro_g r_ivan r_ivan_g r_cat r_cat_g r_doc r_doc_g

B: And after forty-five lessons, a present for Tom: пода́рок То́му! Next time: making plans. Пока́!
    icon e_gift size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["gift","present"] icon_look picture of "wrapped gift"
    text e_line "Пода́рок То́му!" #3d3833 say "Пода́рок То́му!" say_voice b colors {"у$":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 380 font_size 70

